## results
## widening the policy on a full fleet rescheduled all four bindings: k3 (Running) was MOVED from k014-m2 to k014-m1; k1, k2, k4 got Scheduled=False
## ('no enough resource') while their Pods kept running where they were.
## k5: the scheduler logged an error for the unreachable estimator of k014-m1 and placed the unit on k014-m2, which had 4 free GPU on one node after k3 left.
